    "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nGiven the recent changes in laws regarding privacy and the obligation of being conform to the GDPR rules/regulations, I was wondering if InstaPy stores any data of the users' profiles it interacts with. I suppose some data is temporarily stored but I was wondering if any data is saved permanently.\r\n\r\nDoes anyone have an idea?\r\n\r\nThanks!",
